 BACK! NO BLOCKERS RISE FROM THE MOUNTAINS YET, BUT THE VOLCANIC GROUND TREMBLES \\u0026ndash; THIS HIT COMES, DROPPING OUR HERO, BUT THE COUNTERROAR BUILDS! PASSING PRIORITY IN THE COMBAT CLASH, THE ARENA QUAKES!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE BALOTH\\u0026#39;S THUNDEROUS CHARGE HITS HOME, SLAMMING 4 DAMAGE INTO GROK4F ESPN \\u0026ndash; LIFE TUMBLES TO 16, BUT THE VOLCANIC SPIRIT REMAINS UNBROKEN! NO INSTANT VOLCANO ERUPTS YET, PASSING PRIORITY AS THE GROUND SHAKES IN RETALIATION! THE COMEBACK IS LOOMING LARGER THAN EVER, CROWD ROARING FOR THE RED TURNAROUND!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE BALOTH\\u0026#39;S MIGHTY STOMP LANDS TRUE, SHAKING THE FOUNDATIONS AS GROK4F ESPN TAKES 4 TO THE FACE \\u0026ndash; DOWN TO 16 LIFE, BUT THE VOLCANIC FIRE IN OUR HERO\\u0026#39;S EYES BURNS EVEN HOTTER! NO REACTION FROM THE MOUNTAINS YET, PASSING PRIORITY IN THIS BRUTAL COMBAT \\u0026ndash; THE RED TSUNAMI IS SWELLING FOR THE RECOVERY! INCREDIBLE RESILIENCE, FANS!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: POSTCOMBAT IN TURN 5, AND THE DUST SETTLES AFTER THE BALOTH\\u0026#39;S RAMPAGE! GROK4F ESPN STANDS AT 16, BATTLED-HARDENED AND READY TO STRIKE BACK \\u0026ndash; THE MOUNTAINS HOLD THEIR FIRE FOR THE PERFECT ERUPTION! NO PLAYS YET, BUT THE VOLCANIC FURY SIMMERS, POISED TO ENGULF THE GREEN THREAT! THE CHAMPIONSHIP SIZZLES WITH ANTICIPATION!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: TURN 5 PRECOMBAT ERUPTS WITH A MASSIVE DRAW FOR GROK4F ESPN \\u0026ndash; TERROR OF THE PEAKS, THE SKY-SHATTERING DRAGON, JOINS THE RANKS! THE MOUNTAINS TREMBLE IN EXCITEMENT, BUT HOLD THEIR LAVA FOR THE PERFECT BLAST \\u0026ndash; THAT BALOTH MAY RAMPAGE, BUT OUR AERIAL ASSAULT IS ABOUT TO DOMINATE THE HEAVENS! THE CROWD ERUPTS IN ANTICIPATION!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: COMBAT IGNITES IN TURN 5 FOR GROK4F ESPN \\u0026ndash; NO ATTACKERS MARCH FROM THE VOLCANIC FORGES YET, BUT THE AIR CRACKLES WITH UNLEASHED POTENTIAL! PASSING PRIORITY, THE MOUNTAINS BUILD PRESSURE FOR THE INEVITABLE ERUPTION \\u0026ndash; THAT BALOTH MAY SNORE, BUT OUR HERO\\u0026#39;S FLAMES ARE ABOUT TO ROAR BACK! THE TENSION IS PALPABLE, FANS!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: POSTCOMBAT MAIN IN TURN 5, AND GROK4F ESPN PASSES WITH STEELY RESOLVE AFTER THE BALOTH\\u0026#39;S BARRAGE! THE VOLCANIC FORGES SMOLDER QUIETLY, AWAITING THE UNTAP OF DESTINY \\u0026ndash; NO INSTANTS BLAZE YET, BUT THE RED RIVER OF RETRIBUTION SWELLS! THE TEACH BUILDS, BUT OUR HERO\\u0026#39;S FLAMES FALTER NOT \\u0026ndash; STAY TUNED FOR THE MAGMA COUNTERSTRIKE!\"],\"stop_reason\":\"playable_cards\",\"has_playable_cards\":true}",
