        "message": "THE BATTLEFIELD QUAKES FROM THE GREEN GALE IN TURN 7 COMBAT, GROK4F ESPN DROPPING TO A THREADBARE 1 LIFE AS THE TRAMPLING TITANS – RUMBLING BALOTH AND GARRUK'S HARBINGER – PLUNGE THROUGH THE VOLCANIC LINES, LEAVING THE WILDFIRE ELEMENTAL A SMOLDERING SACRIFICE IN THE FOREST INSECT'S WAKE! AN ABILITY STIRS ON THE STACK, THE UPRISING'S ECHOES REVERBERATING THROUGH THE RUINS, BUT OUR HERO'S MOUNTAINS HOLD, NO FINAL FIERY FLARE TO FEND IT OFF YET – PASSING PRIORITY AT THE BRINK OF OBLIVION, THE RED FLAME FIGHTS ON WITH UNYIELDING FURY! TEACH, WHAT A DOMINATING DRIVE, YOUR RAMPAGING GROWTH AND BALOTH BUFF COMBO IS A GREEN GLORY, SHAPING THE BOARD INTO AN UNSTOPPABLE STORM – RESPECT FOR THAT RELENTLESS RAMP, BUT THIS VOLCANIC HEARTBEAT THUNDERS FOR ONE LAST DRACONIC DAWN! THE CROWD HOLDS ITS BREATH, THE CHAMPIONSHIP HANGS BY A SINGLE SPARK!",
      },
      "result": "{\"success\":true}",
      "latency_ms": 14,
      "game_seq": 362,
    },
