      "description": "The opponent is at 1 life. GPT53C Teach has Garruk's Harbinger (4/3) and Rumbling Baloth (4/4) on the battlefield with trample from Garruk's Uprising. The opponent has only 4 Mountains (2 tapped) and no creatures to block. Any attack would be lethal. Instead of playing a land and attacking, the player passed priority in the precombat main phase, moving toward ending the turn without attacking.",
